            "review_title": "Review at Huong Que Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Аленушка С\n1 contribution\n0\nFrustration\nMay 2026 • Family\nUnfortunately, we cannot recommend this restaurant.\n\nWe came here specifically to eat fresh fish. Fish were caught from the aquarium, weighed in front of us, and my husband confirmed its weight. However, while placing the order, it somehow turned out that the fish had \"put on weight\" by almost half a kilogram. Naturally, that raised questions.\n\nTo make sure the weight was correct, we asked for the fish to be re-weighted. We ended up checking her weight three times. By this point, the whole situation had become so unpleasant that the appetite for this unfortunate fish had completely disappeared.\n\nEven more disappointing was the attitude of the staff. Instead of calmly and professionally looking into the situation and helping the guests, it was as if we had come to their home at a bad time and were causing inconvenience with our questions.\n\nMistakes happen everywhere, but the most important thing is honesty, transparency and respect for guests. Unfortunately, that's what we're missing here.\n\nWe left disappointed and we don't plan to come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten June 2, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
