            "review_text": "JerryThefirst\nFolkestone, United Kingdom76 contributions\n0\nPretty traditional restaurant\nOct 2024 • Couples\nLovely little restaurant serving traditional Vietnamese food, all freshly cooked. Varied menu with individual dishes and platters. \nThe banh xeo was lovely, as were all our dishes.\nBeautifully decorated and very reasonably priced.\nNice service and food arrived quickly.\nIt was a little quiet the night we went but we thoroughly enjoyed it.\nRead more\nWritten October 25, 2024",
